Hey [~accountid:641d5e830e6828ab20269e6d] 

It is my understanding that we only confirm the driver is an independent contractor working at Bolt and would not provide any further information.  See below the standard response we send to drivers requesting proof that they work for the Bolt platform (this template response was agreed between legal, Ops and Case managers): 

{color:#bf2600}_“Dear X_{color}

{color:#bf2600}_This letter is to confirm that [insert drivers name] has been working with Bolt as an independent contractor._{color}

{color:#bf2600}_Yours sincerley_{color}

{color:#bf2600}_[Bolt representative]”_{color}

My immediate thoughts are, we would not want to provide any further information than this as it may be construed as we are providing a “reference” for the driver. 

If you need further clarity on this, I would steer you to discussing with the Ops team. 

Please reach out to me on slack if you want to discuss further. 

Cc: [~accountid:5fc110f647ac91006fc4977a] - FYI

Hi [~accountid:603fcbb21c44230072059a01] 

Thank you for raising a ticket with the legal team, please see the response to be sent to the driver below: 

+*RESPONSE TO BE SENT*+

{color:#006644}_Hi [insert name]_{color}

